        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAJOR UPDATE!! All new arcade-style multiplayer gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Space Depot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work Together. Inspect Smart. Ship Fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Depot is a cooperative multiplayer game where players join together as hippos operating a growing space depot. Orders appear on-screen requesting specific materials. Your Job is Simple: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Find the Right Material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Ship It.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it Works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Play with up to 8 of your friends. Individual score is calculate and displayed but the true value comes in cooperation. Achievements are team based. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders Appear - No doubt from deserving hipponauts such as yourself. Thankfully our systems have a general idea of supply, so you'll only get orders that you are able to complete....if you can find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the Clock - Move quickly to inspect boxes to reveal time anomalies that add time to the clock. The longer you have the more you can ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search The Depot - As your moving through the depot don't forget to inspect boxes because that has been shown to reveal anomalies that can add time, more drones, or additional rooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scanning - You'll have access to a scanner which has a cooldown. Use it wisely but never just it. You'll never compete with our Elite Stampeders like that. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAJOR UPDATE!! All new arcade-style multiplayer gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Space Depot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work Together. Inspect Smart. Ship Fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Depot is a cooperative multiplayer game where players join together as hippos operating a growing space depot. Orders appear on-screen requesting specific materials. Your Job is Simple: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Find the Right Material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Ship It.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it Works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Play with up to 8 of your friends. Individual score is calculate and displayed but the true value comes in cooperation. Achievements are team based. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders Appear - No doubt from deserving hipponauts such as yourself. Thankfully our systems have a general idea of supply, so you'll only get orders that you are able to complete....if you can find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the Clock - Move quickly to inspect boxes to reveal time anomalies that add time to the clock. The longer you have the more you can ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search The Depot - As your moving through the depot don't forget to inspect boxes because that has been shown to reveal anomalies that can add time, more drones, or additional rooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scanning - You'll have access to a scanner which has a cooldown. Use it wisely but never just it. You'll never compete with our Elite Stampeders like that. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A fast paced cooperative game where hippos run a growing space depot. Race against the clock to Scan, inspect, and ship the right materials using drones. Try to keep up. Other hipponauts such as yourself are relying on you.",
